  "rootCause": "Post-performance constraint re-check (PR-W1) counted excess_polyphony on the benchmark's two MIDI cases: the Performance Engine lengthens bowed strings (x1.08) so the tails of a four-voice chord still ring at the next chord's onset beyond the 30 ms legato tolerance; the constraint engine then sees 5-6 notes against the strings ceiling of 4. Composition errors were 0 on every candidate; every error was introduced by performance. The engine only clamped monophonic instruments (ceiling 1).",
